  "scope": "Full text of all117 entries read in two bounded batches plus surrounding SELinux section. Mixed entries69/100 and commented entries26/27 distinguished. Not exhaustive extraction/referenced-guide/patch/client qualification.",
  "categories": {
    "INFRA_UI_MONITORING": "Installer/operator/UI/metrics/admin-config and kubectl helper behavior are outside converter API operations; actual transport failures remain errors.",
    "PDB": "Stable policy/v1 selectors and synchronized availability checked; no eviction or PDB writes. Detailed patch correlation pending.",
    "SCC_PSA": "SA SCC checks and Pod dry run remain; converter does not create/assume built-in SCC roles or configure feature gates. Optional static-volume fixture needs its authorized existing SCC.",
    "STORAGE_RUNTIME": "Existing claim/PV/security settings retained; Bound phase/references/topology checked, not resizeStatus/deletion lifecycle. CSI/SELinux/RWOP/local-storage driver and patch qualification pending.",
    "IMAGE_REGISTRY_RUNTIME": "Preserve images/triggers; unresolved tags block plans. Registry/mirror/PKI/proxy/build setup is an external runtime or harness prerequisite.",
    "AUTH_CAPABILITY": "No automatic Secret-name/deployer-account dependency. Opaque credentials, DC discovery/offline paths and explicit errors; invalidated tokens require replacement.",
    "DC_DEPRECATION": "DC still served; informational warning is not API removal.",
    "NETWORK_POLICY_STATUS": "Only NetworkPolicy spec selectors/rules used. Removed status neither read nor written; no CNI readiness inferred.",
    "COMMENT_ONLY": "Commented source table is not an active4.15 API-removal announcement; CSIStorageCapacity earlier removal inventoried.",
    "FUTURE_API_REMOVAL": "Forward reference to1.29 flowcontrol removal; those resources are outside the inventories.",
    "SERVICE_RUNTIME": "Production retains Services/finalizers and checks endpoint identities; no address lifecycle rewrite or load-balancer/proxy configuration.",
    "ADMIN_POLICY": "Optional ANP/BANP selector guard93efcf3 and hash guard132542b; no policy writes.",
    "HARDWARE_RUNTIME": "CPU/device/kubelet podresources behavior not simulated/invoked; dynamic claims require manual review. Hardware/kernel patch correlation pending.",
    "DC_SCALE_WEBHOOK": "Full DC update/admission used; no production scale-subresource call. Harness/controller setup can fail visibly.",
    "LEGACY_STORAGE_GUARD": "CephFS/RBD require manual CSI migration. Mixed entry100 also covers scheduler hints, which the converter does not register/configure.",
    "MIXED_SCHEDULER_STORAGE": "All mixed bullets read: scheduler hints outside inventory; CephFS/RBD deprecation and RBD migration path covered by legacy-storage guard. Extraction boundary audit pending.",
    "HOST_NETWORK_DEFAULT": "hostPort defaulting shifts to actual Pods. Automatic host-namespace execution is already manual; Pod dry run observes admitted fields.",
    "NATIVE_SIDECARS": "Post-floor init restartPolicy requires manual migration under raw baseline validation; existing cluster allocations account for native sidecars.",
    "ACCESS_REVIEW_DEFAULT": "Webhook SAR defaults differ; explicit converter SSAR resource versions now match actual v1/HPA v2/admin-policy endpoints. Empty/wildcard authorizer contracts reproduced prior false refusal and pass after correction. Required-SCC LocalSAR already sets v1; wider client/authorizer guidance remains pending.",
    "QUOTA_ACCOUNTING": "Supported scope matching rejects unknown scopes; full demand retains source usage. PriorityClass server bug patch/controller correlation pending.",
    "PATCH_INTERFACE_UNUSED": "No converter port-forward or strategic-merge deleteFromPrimitiveList; full updates and explicit health URLs used.",
    "ADMITTED_NODE_PLACEMENT": "Pod dry run observes namespace node-selector admission; node eligibility checks admitted nodeName and selectors together. No assumption that API acceptance alone proves placement."
  },
